## Slide 2. Memory and Parquet

- DataFrame memory ${mem_before} MiB → ${mem_after} MiB (${mem_saved_pct} % smaller): Time `int32`, Class `int8`, V1–V28 `float32`, Amount stays `float64`
- Every cast is verified (integer-valued, in range, relative error < 1e-6)
- CSV ${csv_mib} MiB → Parquet ${parquet_mib} MiB (${parquet_saved_pct} % smaller)
